#X text 240 83 the object routes each incoming message to the next
outlet in a round-robin manner \, cycling through all outlets;
#X text 240 138 @offset sets the starting outlet index \, @step sets
how many outlets to skip after each message (the step can be negative
for reverse rotation);
#X text 240 193 a bang on the second inlet resets the current outlet
index to the initial value;
#X text 240 233 notice: to get properties \, use the [prop.get] object
\, since all messages (including property requests) are passed through;
#X text 240 288 the object can be used to distribute events over several
destinations in turn \, for example to trigger different sounds or
effects in rotation;
